; CLOSE-FIGHTER WAVE 1 (sl-0213; variety rule f): THE PACK CIRCLER —
; the wolf's OWN archetype, nobody else's. FLANKER orbit at the
; [2.2, 3.2] band (chirality by id parity: a pack surrounds from both
; sides by construction) + the press (an open bite gate turns the
; orbit into a committed lunge; the swing re-arms it and the circle
; resumes — lunge-and-out). Cutoff darts fly WHILE it circles: the
; pack cuts off escape lines, the bullets are real. Replaces the
; sl-0104 rusher-slash chaser whose arcs whiffed the 0.175 body
; (sl-0208 finding). Lead 14 bite / 18 dart, exact. All numbers [T].

